# Text files are stored and checked out with LF on every platform; Git detects
# binary files (WAVs, images) and leaves them alone. Later lines override this.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Unified patch context uses a single space for an unchanged blank line.
patches/*.patch -whitespace
# The lane's pathsim patch is copied verbatim and mixes CRLF and LF lines
# (upstream stores some files with CRLF); keep its bytes exact so its sha256
# matches the lane copy whatever the clone's end-of-line policy.
patches/pathsim-*.patch -text
